  user_input {
    user_response: "I am owner of Trade2Turkey and I need an application for managing export logistics and tracking shipments. I also want to use it in sourcing process to show how I choose and verify the suppliers. I want to give my clients access to all evidences about the entire verification process and quality control documentation. This should include a secure portal for real-time document, sharing and automated updates on status changes and shipment milestones accessible for both deskop and mobile devices. This should also include a dashboard how trade2turkey score and evaluate suppliers and how trade2turkey calculate granular cost of each product with transparent breakdown in component level (Costing of materials in recipy) for informed decision-making for all stakeholders. I want to user-friendly interface for data entry and real-time report generation. \nIn the app, you can see standart operating procedure, and there are 2 different major services. 1 is Section A: Sourcing and second is Section B: Strategic Project Alignment & Coordination. The application shows these 2 part separetly. \nOn the other hand, there are some minor sheets which is related with Section A: Sourcing. The names of these sections as follows, Creation Target Spesification,Request for Quote (RFQ) Submission,RFQ Comparative Matrix,Creation Product Recipy ,Costing - Value Chain, Costing of materials in recipy. The app should redirect the user to the related minor sheets when the user clicks on the SOP area in major pages. Minor pages should be embedded in SOP in Major services. "
    items {
      text: "I am owner of Trade2Turkey and I need an application for managing export logistics and tracking shipments. I also want to use it in sourcing process to show how I choose and verify the suppliers. I want to give my clients access to all evidences about the entire verification process and quality control documentation. This should include a secure portal for real-time document, sharing and automated updates on status changes and shipment milestones accessible for both deskop and mobile devices. This should also include a dashboard how trade2turkey score and evaluate suppliers and how trade2turkey calculate granular cost of each product with transparent breakdown in component level (Costing of materials in recipy) for informed decision-making for all stakeholders. I want to user-friendly interface for data entry and real-time report generation. \nIn the app, you can see standart operating procedure, and there are 2 different major services. 1 is Section A: Sourcing and second is Section B: Strategic Project Alignment & Coordination. The application shows these 2 part separetly. \nOn the other hand, there are some minor sheets which is related with Section A: Sourcing. The names of these sections as follows, Creation Target Spesification,Request for Quote (RFQ) Submission,RFQ Comparative Matrix,Creation Product Recipy ,Costing - Value Chain, Costing of materials in recipy. The app should redirect the user to the related minor sheets when the user clicks on the SOP area in major pages. Minor pages should be embedded in SOP in Major services. "
    }
    media {
