    thinking: "**Building Section B Logistics**\n\nOkay, the sourcing SOP is complete, which is excellent. I\'m now focused on constructing Section B, which is `LogisticsSOP.tsx`. I need to figure out the specific components that will be included, and how they will handle strategic project alignment, inventory, tracking, and online fulfillment.\n\n\n**Defining Section B Scope**\n\nOkay, so I\'ve finalized the section breakdown. I\'m structuring Section B around three key components: Strategic Project Alignment & Coordination, a Logistics Milestone & Tracker, an Inventory Forecasting Console, and a Multi-channel Order Fulfillment Cabinet. I am thinking of a simple structure for B.A, B.B, and B.C. The milestone tracker will have interactive elements, and I\'ll include user-triggered state updates. The forecasting console is going to be my best piece!\n\n\n"
