  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Key Modules**\n\nI\'ve just finished the core modules. I\'ve got the foundational structure sorted in `src/types.ts` with domains and SOP values. The user interface now has a clear header in `src/components/Navbar.tsx`. The main SOP pipeline (Section A) is also built in `src/components/SourcingSOP.tsx`. I\'m feeling confident about this foundation.\n\n\n**Building Out New Features**\n\nI\'m now integrating several new interactive sheets and SOP components. Specifically, I\'m focusing on the `MinorSheets`, the `LogisticsSOP` (Section B), the `SupplierScoring` system, and the `ClientPortal`, followed by a `ReportGenerator`. My focus now shifts to replacing `/src/App.tsx`, driving the application and connecting all states. I\'ll initialize the app\'s state variables from `types.ts` and manage persistent storage using `localStorage` to preserve data across reloads.\n\n\n**Implementing Tabbed Navigation**\n\nI\'ve got the tab interface working within `App.tsx`! I\'ve included the Navbar and dynamic view components. The active view toggles seamlessly between `\"sourcing\"`, `\"logistics\"`, `\"suppliers\"`, `\"client-portal\"`, and `\"report\"`. The `\"sourcing\"` view smartly integrates `MinorSheets.tsx` when a `minorSheetKey` is active. I\'ve also incorporated the \"\360\237\223\234 Draw Audit Report\" button for instant report access.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
