  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Confirming Build Success**\n\nI\'m incredibly pleased! Both `lint_applet` and `compile_applet` completed flawlessly, with zero errors or warnings. Now, I\'m verifying the scope. The \"Trade2Turkey Export Logistics & Sourcing App\" is beautifully branded with a warm Terracotta/Crimson Turkey theme, and I\'m moving on to the next.\n\n\n**Structuring SOP Areas**\n\nI\'ve successfully structured the two major services, Sourcing and Strategic Project Alignment, into distinct sections. Embedding and redirecting SOP areas within the major pages is also complete, with embedded sheets opening directly, and a back control added. I\'ve finished the following Minor Sheets: Creation Target Specification, Request for Quote (RFQ) Submission, RFQ Comparative Matrix, Creation Product Recipe, and Costing - Value Chain, as well as Costing of Materials in the Recipe.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have designed and built a highly polished, responsive **Trade2Turkey Export Logistics & Sourcing Audit Hub** tailored strictly to your instructions. \n\nThe application is structured into your two major services (Section A & Section B) and embeds the six interactive minor sheets directly into the Standard Operating Procedure (SOP) tables. All data is backed by an automated local state persistence engine to ensure your customized values remain saved across browser reloads.\n\n### \360\237\214\237 Core Design & Aesthetic Choices\n\n- **Anatolian Terracotta Theme**: Styled with a professional Turkish terracotta color scheme, featuring deep offsets of slate grays and elegant off-white backgrounds that create visual contrast and spacious structural density.\n- **Micro-Animations & Visual Cues**: Leverages smooth layout transitions, responsive hover states, and key alert signals to highlight items in need of urgent attention (like low inventory levels or budget breaches).\n- **Desktop + Mobile Fluidity**: Specifically optimized for both desktop monitors and touch devices, featuring flexible grid adapters and collapsible tables suited for tablets and phones.\n\n---\n\n### \360\237\232\200 High-Level Functional Modules\n\n#### 1. Major Service A: Sourcing Process SOP\n- **Interactive Lifecycle Table**: Tracks all 21 standard Turkey-sourcing milestones from Discovery to Commercial Contract sign-off.\n- **Embedded Minor Sheet Redirections**: Clicking any SOP step representing a minor sheet transforms the page into the dedicated interactive solver. The six embedded minor sheets are:\n  - **Creation Target Specification (A.A.2)**: A dynamic blueprint form editor to dictate cover fabric metrics, core density fillings, safety certificates (REACH, BS5852), and compressed double-polybag packaging instructions.\n  - **Request for Quote (RFQ) Submission (A.A.4)**: Displays active campaigns, accepts incoming supplier quotations, and generates copyable outgoing, customized RFQ email templates.\n  - **Costing - Value Chain (A.A.6)**: Interactive landed cost calculator computing EXW unit prices, domestic transport, export customs, ocean container freight, duties, and warehousing down to landed-cost percentages.\n  - **RFQ Comparative Matrix (A.B.6)**: Custom weighted solver side-by-side comparison that automatically scores manufacturers and highlights the best choice based on your priorities (Price vs. Quality vs. Lead Time).\n  - **Creation Product Recipe (A.B.8)**: Structured Bill-of-Materials (BOM) canvas for designing component ratio parts down to zipper lengths, thread meters, and fabric sizes.\n  - **Costing of Materials in Recipe (A.B.9)**: Granular material costing sheet factoring in scrap-wastage coefficients, labor, and packaging fees. Includes an automated warnings guard if the budget exceeds targets.\n\n#### 2. Major Service B: Project Alignment, Logistics & Fulfillment\n- **Live Vessel Milestones Tracker (B.A)**: Recreates real-time ocean passage legs (Port of Ambarli, Istanbul to Port of Rotterdam) of active Turkish shipments alongside pre-shipping photography proofs verified by the site inspection teams.\n- **Inventory & Forecast Console (B.B)**: Input sales velocities, physical count metrics, and committed orders to immediately view safety stock coverage margins and reorder-point thresholds.\n- **Multi-Store Fulfillment Hub (B.C)**: Pulls incoming orders from Shopify, Amazon, and Walmart, allows lookup of carrier rates (DHL, DPD, UPS), compiles shipping labels, attaches cargo photoshoot proofs, and auto-deducts stocks synchronized across stores.\n\n#### 3. Supplier Scoring & Verification Evaluator\n- **Strategic Scoring Sliders**: Score Anatolian factories dynamically based on Sew Quality, Pricing, and Communication lead-times to recalculate gold-rating composite ranks.\n- **Verification Milestones Vault**: Controls checkboxes for Signed NDAs, Sample QC sign-offs, and site audit completions which load secure compliance certificates ready for stakeholder access.\n\n#### 4. Secure Client & Stakeholder Portal\n- Secure gateway mimicking overseas client access. Includes dedicated views for real-time cargo container locations, downloadable notarized certifications, and a component-level transparent recipe list proving sourcing integrity.\n\n#### 5. Real-Time Report Generator\n- User-friendly print compiler. Assemble combined PDF summaries of active SOP milestones, evaluated suppliers, and granular pricing breakdowns with customized titles and recipient emails.\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 3
      nanos: 391563423
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
