  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Professional Polish\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Professional Polish\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"flex flex-col h-[768px] w-[1024px] bg-slate-50 font-sans text-slate-800 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n  <!-- Top Navigation Bar -->\\n  <header class=\\\"h-16 bg-slate-900 flex items-center justify-between px-6 shrink-0 border-b border-slate-700\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center space-x-4\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 bg-blue-600 rounded flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-white text-xl\\\">T2T</div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h1 class=\\\"text-white font-semibold text-lg leading-tight\\\">Trade2Turkey | Management Portal</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-slate-400 text-xs\\\">Export Logistics & Sourcing Intelligence</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center space-x-6\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex space-x-2\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"px-3 py-1 bg-green-500/20 text-green-400 border border-green-500/30 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider\\\">System Online</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"h-8 w-px bg-slate-700\\\"></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center space-x-3\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"text-right\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-white text-xs font-medium\\\">Acme Global Ops</p>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-slate-400 text-[10px]\\\">Premium Access Tier</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-700 border border-slate-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xs\\\">JD</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <!-- Major Services Toggle -->\\n  <nav class=\\\"h-12 bg-white border-b border-slate-200 flex items-center px-6 space-x-8 shrink-0\\\">\\n    <button class=\\\"h-full border-b-2 border-blue-600 text-blue-600 font-bold text-sm px-4 flex items-center\\\">\\n      Section A: Sourcing\\n    </button>\\n    <button class=\\\"h-full border-b-2 border-transparent text-slate-500 font-medium text-sm px-4 flex items-center hover:text-slate-700\\\">\\n      Section B: Strategic Project Alignment & Coordination\\n    </button>\\n  </nav>\\n\\n  <!-- Main Content Area -->\\n  <main class=\\\"flex-1 flex overflow-hidden\\\">\\n    <!-- SOP Workflow Sidebar (Minor Sheets) -->\\n    <aside class=\\\"w-64 bg-slate-100 border-r border-slate-200 flex flex-col shrink-0\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"p-4\\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3\\\">Standard Operating Procedure</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-1\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"w-full text-left px-3 py-2 rounded text-xs font-medium bg-white text-slate-900 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-slate-200 flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n            <span>Creation Target Spec</span>\\n            <div class=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500\\\"></div>\\n          </button>\\n          <button class=\\\"w-full text-left px-3 py-2 rounded text-xs font-medium text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-200 flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n            <span>RFQ Submission</span>\\n            <div class=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500\\\"></div>\\n          </button>\\n          <button class=\\\"w-full text-left px-3 py-2 rounded text-xs font-medium text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-200 flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n            <span>RFQ Comparative Matrix</span>\\n            <div class=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500\\\"></div>\\n          </button>\\n          <button class=\\\"w-full text-left px-3 py-2 rounded text-xs font-medium text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-200 flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n            <span>Creation Product Recipe</span>\\n            <div class=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500\\\"></div>\\n          </button>\\n          <button class=\\\"w-full text-left px-3 py-2 rounded text-xs font-bold bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 ring-1 ring-blue-100 flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n            <span>Costing - Value Chain</span>\\n            <div class=\\\"w-3 h-3 flex items-center justify-center\\\"><div class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600\\\"></div></div>\\n          </button>\\n          <button class=\\\"w-full text-left px-3 py-2 rounded text-xs font-medium text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-200 flex justify-between items-center opacity-60\\\">\\n            <span>Material Costing (Recipe)</span>\\n            <div class=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-slate-300\\\"></div>\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"mt-auto p-4 border-t border-slate-200\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-white rounded p-3 shadow-sm border border-slate-200\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase mb-1\\\">Logistics Status</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs\\\">\\n            <span>Shipment TR-882</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-blue-600 font-bold\\\">On Route</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"mt-2 h-1.5 w-full bg-slate-100 rounded-full overflow-hidden\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"h-full bg-blue-500 w-3/4\\\"></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </aside>\\n\\n    <!-- Detail Sheet View: Costing - Value Chain -->\\n    <div class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col min-w-0 bg-white\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"p-6 border-b border-slate-100 flex justify-between items-end\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <nav class=\\\"flex text-[10px] text-slate-400 mb-1 space-x-1\\\">\\n            <span>Sourcing</span>\\n            <span>/</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-slate-600\\\">Minor Sheet: Value Chain</span>\\n          </nav>\\n          <h2 class=\\\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900\\\">Granular Costing Breakdown</h2>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm text-slate-500\\\">Product ID: #T2T-TEXT-042 | Cotton-Poly Blend Hoodie</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex space-x-2\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"px-4 py-2 border border-slate-200 rounded text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-slate-50\\\">Export PDF</button>\\n          <button class=\\\"px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded text-xs font-semibold\\\">Update Values</button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"flex-1 p-6 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n        <!-- Costing Table -->\\n        <div class=\\\"border border-slate-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden\\\">\\n          <table class=\\\"w-full text-left text-xs\\\">\\n            <thead class=\\\"bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200\\\">\\n              <tr>\\n                <th class=\\\"px-4 py-3 font-bold text-slate-600 uppercase tracking-wider\\\">Component Name</th>\\n                <th class=\\\"px-4 py-3 font-bold text-slate-600 uppercase tracking-wider\\\">Specification</th>\\n                <th class=\\\"px-4 py-3 font-bold text-slate-600 uppercase tracking-wider text-right\\\">Unit Cost (USD)</th>\\n                <th class=\\\"px-4 py-3 font-bold text-slate-600 uppercase tracking-wider text-right\\\">Consumption</th>\\n                <th class=\\\"px-4 py-3 font-bold text-slate-600 uppercase tracking-wider text-right\\\">Total Cost</th>\\n              </tr>\\n            </thead>\\n            <tbody class=\\\"divide-y divide-slate-100\\\">\\n              <tr>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-3 font-medium\\\">Raw Cotton Yarn</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-3 text-slate-500\\\">Combed Cotton 30/1</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-3 text-right\\\">$3.42</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-3 text-right\\\">1.2 kg</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-3 text-right font-semibold text-slate-900\\\">$4.10</td>\\n              </tr>\\n              <tr>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-3 font-medium\\\">Polyester Fiber</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-3 text-slate-500\\\">Recycled Poly</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-3 text-right\\\">$1.85</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-3 text-right\\\">0.3 kg</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-3 text-right font-semibold text-slate-900\\\">$0.55</td>\\n              </tr>\\n              <tr>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-3 font-medium\\\">Dyeing & Finishing</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-3 text-slate-500\\\">Reactive Dyeing</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-3 text-right\\\">$0.90</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-3 text-right\\\">1.5 kg</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-3 text-right font-semibold text-slate-900\\\">$1.35</td>\\n              </tr>\\n              <tr>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-3 font-medium\\\">Trims & Accessories</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-3 text-slate-500\\\">YKK Zippers / Poly Bags</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-3 text-right\\\">$0.75</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-3 text-right\\\">1 unit</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-3 text-right font-semibold text-slate-900\\\">$0.75</td>\\n              </tr>\\n              <tr class=\\\"bg-blue-50/30\\\">\\n                <td colspan=\\\"4\\\" class=\\\"px-4 py-3 text-right font-bold text-slate-500\\\">Sub-Total Manufacturing Cost</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-4 py-3 text-right font-bold text-blue-600\\\">$6.75</td>\\n              </tr>\\n            </tbody>\\n          </table>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Supplier & QC Summary -->\\n        <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-6\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded border border-slate-200\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center mb-2\\\">\\n              <h4 class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase\\\">Supplier Scorecard</h4>\\n              <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-blue-600\\\">Verified</span>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"flex items-center space-x-3\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"text-2xl font-bold\\\">8.4</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 leading-tight\\\">Top 10% of textile exporters in Marmara region.</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded border border-slate-200\\\">\\n            <h4 class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase mb-2\\\">QC Evidence Access</h4>\\n            <div class=\\\"space-y-1\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-[10px] text-slate-700 font-medium\\\">\\n                <svg class=\\\"w-3 h-3 text-red-500\\\" fill=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\"><path d=\\\"M4 4a2 2 0 012-2h4.586A2 2 0 0112 2.586L15.414 6A2 2 0 0116 7.414V16a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V4z\\\"></path></svg>\\n                <span>Tensile_Strength_Report.pdf</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-[10px] text-slate-700 font-medium\\\">\\n                <svg class=\\\"w-3 h-3 text-red-500\\\" fill=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\"><path d=\\\"M4 4a2 2 0 012-2h4.586A2 2 0 0112 2.586L15.414 6A2 2 0 0116 7.414V16a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V4z\\\"></path></svg>\\n                <span>OEKO-TEX_Certificate.pdf</span>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded border border-slate-200\\\">\\n            <h4 class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase mb-2\\\">Logistics Breakdown</h4>\\n            <div class=\\\"space-y-1 text-[10px]\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"flex justify-between\\\"><span>Inland (Turkey):</span><span class=\\\"font-semibold\\\">$0.45</span></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"flex justify-between\\\"><span>Ocean Freight:</span><span class=\\\"font-semibold\\\">$1.10</span></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"flex justify-between\\\"><span>Insurance:</span><span class=\\\"font-semibold\\\">$0.12</span></div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- Footer Status Bar -->\\n      <footer class=\\\"h-8 bg-slate-100 border-t border-slate-200 flex items-center px-6 justify-between shrink-0\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex items-center space-x-4\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"flex items-center text-[10px] text-slate-500\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 mr-2\\\"></span>\\n            Connected to Istanbul Office Node\\n          </span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-medium\\\">\\n          Last Sync: Today at 14:32:01 GMT+3\\n        </div>\\n      </footer>\\n    </div>\\n  </main>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
