  user_input {
    user_response: "**Shared Folder & Real-Time Document Integration Rules:**\n1. The application must map each task\'s \"Digital Storing Location\" directly to a real-time cloud storage folder (e.g., Google Drive API).\n2. When a user or client navigates to a specific SOP step (Major or Minor), the app must dynamically fetch and display the files (PDFs, RFQ sheets, certificates, photoshoot proofs) from the designated \"Digital Storing Location\" column in the CSV files.\n3. Client Access Control: B2B Clients must only have read-access to the folders and files associated with their specific project ID, ensuring high security and transparency.\n4. Automated Updates: When a new file (e.g., Photoshoot as Proof for step B.C.7) is uploaded to the Shared Folder, the task status should automatically change to \"Completed\" and trigger a real-time update on the client\'s mobile/desktop dashboard."
    items {
      text: "**Shared Folder & Real-Time Document Integration Rules:**\n1. The application must map each task\'s \"Digital Storing Location\" directly to a real-time cloud storage folder (e.g., Google Drive API).\n2. When a user or client navigates to a specific SOP step (Major or Minor), the app must dynamically fetch and display the files (PDFs, RFQ sheets, certificates, photoshoot proofs) from the designated \"Digital Storing Location\" column in the CSV files.\n3. Client Access Control: B2B Clients must only have read-access to the folders and files associated with their specific project ID, ensuring high security and transparency.\n4. Automated Updates: When a new file (e.g., Photoshoot as Proof for step B.C.7) is uploaded to the Shared Folder, the task status should automatically change to \"Completed\" and trigger a real-time update on the client\'s mobile/desktop dashboard."
