    modified_response: "I will create `/src/components/GoogleDriveFolder.tsx` to serve as a secure visual dashboard for the synced Google Drive folders. It parses the metadata from our CSV file, checks for client security clearances based on Project ID, and automates step-by-step handshakes (such as setting the status to \"Completed\" and dispatching real-time state changes on new uploads)."
