ow integrating the file type, name, and project information into the new file object.\n\n\n**Handling Unauthenticated Users**\n\nI\'m now integrating logic for users without an active Google Drive connection within `handlePhysicalFileUpload`. I\'m going to determine a connection state check, and if the user is unauthenticated I am going to trigger the login flow, possibly by using a button to authenticate with Google. Otherwise, I will proceed to upload the file, and then persist the file data in local storage.\n\n\n"
