      title: "google.com"
    }
    web_documents {
      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF3LfovXT5g5_oTB32d-7uezD32cAsBOO4ureFeM2gNRZ-BPztQLs0lh4sO4RnrakYvag7nFAwlbZAFZoayanGtxuJCQxFsdtA2Q0alQMQhLRx1xonEut6FfKWCp9PMPohxSVcp4VDlvgH7XLBC29DcyCYSSddjCrQaQVxG"
      title: "google.com"
    }
    web_documents {
      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFkyDGePDrK_MsGNYqb9XHPkN6CIdxZ0NhAz2JQ8JxGtlXv9erYQGJztpW-OKOBA0Q9_t54y6QoaJqKKV3TEQDsSPjir1J_0Cdy7VQxDkcxP1NJi7bLO1nnaR44kMdZdNqn1CWA9y3TrSOP9_LeUSvNUKg_ihEh-VF1KL95U2yhItUH3l4FbSvxQA=="
      title: "google.com"
    }
    summary: "The error message \"No location information provided in request side-channel\" when interacting with Google Cloud Platform (GCP) OAuth APIs typically indicates that a required geographical location identifier is missing from the API request or its associated configuration. This issue often arises in specific contexts within GCP, particularly when dealing with resources that are inherently location-bound, such as those used with Workforce Identity Federation.\n\nKey aspects related to this error include:\n\n*   **Resource Naming Conventions** Many GCP resources, including `oauthClients` within Identity and Access Management (IAM), follow a naming convention that includes a `location` parameter (e.g., `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/oauthClients/{oauthClient}`). If an API call targets such a resource without specifying the required location in the request path, this error can occur.[1]\n*   **Workforce Identity Federation** The `OauthClient` resource is integral for accessing Google Cloud resources on behalf of Workforce Identity Federation users.[1] Workforce Identity Federation allows external identity providers to grant users access to GCP. Setting up these federations often involves a Google Cloud organization and specific configurations, where location can be a critical factor for routing and access.[2]\n*   **Missing or Misconfigured Location** The \"side-channel\" in the error suggests that the location information is expected to be conveyed alongside the primary request, possibly as part of the API endpoint\'s URL structure or within specific request headers or parameters. A common cause is either the complete omission of this required location data or its incorrect specification.\n*   **Distinction from other OAuth errors** This specific error differs from other common OAuth issues like `redirect_uri_mismatch`, `invalid_client`, or `missing scope`.[3][4] It points directly to a missing geographical context rather than authentication, authorization, or redirection problems.\n\nTo resolve this error, users should:\n1.  **Identify the specific API and resource** being called that is generating the error.\n2.  **Examine the API documentation** for that particular resource to understand if it requires a `location` parameter and how it should be provided (e.g., in the URL path, query parameter, or request body).\n3.  **Verify the configuration of their OAuth client** and any associated Workforce Identity Federation settings in the Google Cloud Console, ensuring all location-specific requirements are met and correctly configured.\n4.  **Ensure the API request itself includes the necessary location information** as specified by the API and the relevant GCP resource.\n\nSources:\n[1] [google.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEdghrB7GPBb8MR7BGF-GcP9v2z53ratPDXud_RxvUBg26VEYviqLPeYHJIhIwVagNEAGta5HG23H-I930Qd6RqgF_haZiH4KiDsRKttfLS-tUgOa8UMitNQ04Dpw9NQFhsEnGLYbKByWKGeUaP2csXLBkOIQrgdOpM3f4vUVUldER92BBqwg0ng45uglISwKMBTw==)\n[2] [google.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG-XYhS_C6AscXkBN9OfH_ojtEp3VJyH2xnzfLS5KaY0WMCBJjACRMu-UvYL4fpQ7D5KoWit7o54RmBzppcEojakY6ylSOgG8G17Jccc7V9PQ13SylbLq74sMoFc3l-bE8h0K7aiLmZpIGhZFovPy3pmadeQPtkOLhghQQ=)\n[3] [google.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF3LfovXT5g5_oTB32d-7uezD32cAsBOO4ureFeM2gNRZ-BPztQLs0lh4sO4RnrakYvag7nFAwlbZAFZoayanGtxuJCQxFsdtA2Q0alQMQhLRx1xonEut6FfKWCp9PMPohxSVcp4VDlvgH7XLBC29DcyCYSSddjCrQaQVxG)\n[4] [google.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFkyDGePDrK_MsGNYqb9XHPkN6CIdxZ0NhAz2JQ8JxGtlXv9erYQGJztpW-OKOBA0Q9_t54y6QoaJqKKV3TEQDsSPjir1J_0Cdy7VQxDkcxP1NJi7bLO1nnaR44kMdZdNqn1CWA9y3TrSOP9_LeUSvNUKg_ihEh-VF1KL95U2yhItUH3l4FbSvxQA==)"
    search_type: SEARCH_WEB_TYPE_WEB
  }
}
